.Dd November 17, 2026
.Dt KILL 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm kill
.Nd send a signal to a process or process group
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Fl l
.Op Ar name | number
.Nm
.Op Fl s Ar signal | Fl signal
.Ar pid ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
sends a signal to each
.Ar pid .
A positive target names a process; a negative target names a process group;
zero names the caller's process group.
.Pp
Signal names are accepted with or without a
.Ql SIG
prefix.
The number 0 performs an existence check without sending a signal.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl l
List signal names, or print the name/number of one signal.
.It Fl s Ar signal
Select the signal by name or number.
.It Fl Ar signal
Select the signal by name or number.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
An unknown signal, missing target or failed target exits 1; a usage error
exits 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr nice 1 ,
.Xr signal 3
.Sh STANDARDS
IEEE Std 1003.1-2024
.Pq POSIX.1-2024 .
